/// Scale is free from $\exp(\mathbb{E}[\ln Y])$; Dagum $a\neq 1$ and $q\neq 1$ are pinned, not identification `p`. Distinct from [`DagumHmm`] (half-line) and [`UnitBurrHmm`].
