/// Scale is free from $\exp(\mathbb{E}[\ln Y])$; location $\mu\neq 0$ and shape $\beta\notin\{1,2\}$ are pinned, not identification `p`. Distinct from [`BetaFoldedExponentialPowerHmm`] and [`UnitFoldedExponentialPowerHmm`].
