/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine31Hmm`] ($\cos^{31}$) and [`UnitCosine30Hmm`] ($\cos^{30}$).
